{"id":"661443","name":"番茄鸡蛋豆腐汤","author":"开心肥羊","authorId":"389860","desc":"","cover":"images/661443/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"番茄","amount":"1个"},{"name":"水豆腐","amount":"1块"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1只"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"番茄切小块。","img":"images/661443/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"水豆腐一样切小块。","img":"images/661443/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中倒入适量清水，水开后倒入少许食用油。","img":"images/661443/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加盐、鸡粉。","img":"images/661443/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入豆腐、番茄，煮至沸腾。","img":"images/661443/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"烧开后打入鸡蛋，搅散。","img":"images/661443/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"滴入少许生抽。","img":"images/661443/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"撒入胡椒粉，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/661443/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"最后撒点葱花即可。","img":"images/661443/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}